{"unit_id":"jackeyunjie__dsh-rule-lens#card-zh","repo":"jackeyunjie/dsh-rule-lens","commit":"c9caf8c19ee27ddd52438bc0c702764f7e0d6331","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"RuleScope Lens（规则透镜）是面向 DSH Web 与 TUI 的本地规则管理插件。它在会话步骤中注入规则文件，并在工具调用前执行防护，同时提供 Web 面板查看状态。插件按层发现用户和工作区规则，支持子目录规则按需注入、白名单目录、64KB 默认预算与超限淘汰；可拦截对既有 Markdown 文件的全文覆写，并按规则中的 FORBID 声明拦截工具操作。面板提供规则 Lint、注入与遵守情况、预算状态、预热开关和日志导出。适合希望让 DSH 按项目规则工作并检查规则注入情况的用户。需要 Node.js 22 或更高版本，不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:196-281","lib/rules.js:154-187","lib/panel.js:153-238"]}
{"unit_id":"jackeyunjie__dsh-rule-lens#card-en","repo":"jackeyunjie/dsh-rule-lens","commit":"c9caf8c19ee27ddd52438bc0c702764f7e0d6331","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"RuleScope Lens is a local DSH plugin for loading layered rules and inspecting them in a web panel. It supports on-demand subdirectory rules, a 64 KB default budget, FORBID guards, Markdown overwrite blocking, rule lint, and log export. Requires Node.js 22+; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:196-281","lib/rules.js:154-187","lib/panel.js:153-238"]}
